ventual measurement phase; this design defines it but does not produce it.\\n\\n---\\n\\nEnd of design document. Implementation is not in scope; reviewers are invited to comment on the (a) workload grid, (b) the choice of K4V4 vs K4V16 as the single KV ablation, (c) the success criteria in Section 4, and (d) the threats listed in Section 7.2.\\nMD\\necho \\\"Final appended, $(wc -c < /workspace/quarot_llama2_experiment_design.md) bytes, $(wc -l < /workspace/quarot_llama2_experiment_design.md) lines\\\"\\nls -la /workspace/\", \"exit_code\": 0, \"timed_out\": false, \"elapsed_seconds\": 0.016, \"output\": \"Final appended, 27558 bytes, 282 lines\\ntotal 36\\ndrwx------  2 1776737281 748400513  4096 Oct 21 23:12 .\\ndrwxr-xr-x 12 1776737281 748400513   240 Oct 21 23:13 ..\\n-rw-------  1 1776737281 748400513 27558 Oct 21 23:13 quarot_llama2_experiment_design.md\\n-rw-------  1 1776737281 748400513   405 Oct 21 23:04 task.json\\n\", \"output_truncated\": false}"}], "is_error": false, "kind": "BenchmarkObservation"}, "action_id": "02217a97-d5fb-4902-a8c4-e8432d989514", "extended_content": [], "kind": "ObservationEvent", "source_event_index": 46}
